{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-a87e42d8b5c4", "start_time": "2026-09-22T10:39:34.911Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 0, "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:39:42.247Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 13372, "tokens_out": 111, "latency": 7.3127, "finish_reason": "tool_use"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "What does the Thornfield Commercial Property wording say about business interruption cover?", "prompt_hash": "sha256:b3db0fc73e66aa44de0a8c455dc234ae0485a646d88a7a817a855fdee8fa3c36", "response_text": "I'll search the Thornfield Mutual documents for information about business interruption cover in the Commercial Property wording.", "response_hash": "sha256:fadad7fe4061195b908df8379ab85977d1cd5819f16f0f4b1fd94f8430c1098a", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-a87e42d8b5c4", "start_time": "2026-09-22T10:39:34.911Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 1, "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:39:42.506Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 15142, "tokens_out": 190, "latency": 0.2572, "finish_reason": "end_turn"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "What does the Thornfield Commercial Property wording say about business interruption cover?", "prompt_hash": "sha256:b3db0fc73e66aa44de0a8c455dc234ae0485a646d88a7a817a855fdee8fa3c36", "response_text": "Based on the Thornfield Mutual documents, the **Thornfield Commercial Property** wording covers business interruption as follows (pol-commprop-003):\n\n**Section 2, business interruption:**\n- Loss of gross profit following damage covered under Section 1, for the indemnity period stated in the schedule\n- Standard indemnity periods are twelve, eighteen or twenty-four months\n- Increased cost of working is covered where the spend reduces the loss of gross profit by at least the amount spent\n- Denial of access is covered up to £250,000 where damage within a one mile radius prevents access\n\nThe cover applies to businesses with a declared turnover up to £25,000,000.\n\nIf you need more detailed information from the full policy wording (such as exclusions, conditions or definitions), let me know and I can search for additional passages.", "response_hash": "sha256:0375133db509299e9cdbf7be2a1d6ae07ddf236e950472cf39a5ead81f76deba", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
